{"bangumi":{"date":"2018-04-21","platform":"WEB","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/31/7f/226615_HVAWW.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/31/7f/226615_HVAWW.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/31/7f/226615_HVAWW.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/31/7f/226615_HVAWW.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/31/7f/226615_HVAWW.jpg"},"summary":"半夜醒来的神乐。揉着眼睛来到庭院。庭院里开着樱花，花瓣不时散落一地，就着月色，格外漂亮。 神乐就坐了在正对着庭院的走廊下，一边纳凉一边赏花。神乐：（自言自语）晚上的庭院，仿佛随时都会发生什么似的呢……突然一只蝴蝶从神乐的眼前飞过，带着闪亮亮的鳞粉。蝴蝶精：是的哟。晚上，的确很适合讲故事呢。神乐在鳞粉的作用下，就开始困倦，眼皮也开始一开一合。耳边也隐约传来了另一个声音。食梦貘：噗，我不像你有翅膀啦，等等我噗——蝴蝶精：快点快点啦，神乐大人睡着之后——蝴蝶精：就是梦中故事的开始啦！ ","name":"阴阳师·平安物语","name_cn":"阴阳师·平安物语","tags":[{"name":"泡面番","count":155,"total_count":153750},{"name":"国产","count":144,"total_count":160338},{"name":"游戏改","count":116,"total_count":162141},{"name":"2018年4月","count":59,"total_count":21838},{"name":"阴阳师","count":52,"total_count":359},{"name":"2018","count":45,"total_count":77813},{"name":"震雷动画","count":34,"total_count":192},{"name":"TV","count":30,"total_count":1396842},{"name":"中日","count":30,"total_count":190},{"name":"治愈","count":24,"total_count":300691},{"name":"日常","count":20,"total_count":398090},{"name":"WEB","count":17,"total_count":71522},{"name":"BLADE","count":17,"total_count":756},{"name":"搞笑","count":12,"total_count":635972},{"name":"手游改","count":9,"total_count":2643},{"name":"中国","count":8,"total_count":31411},{"name":"国漫","count":4,"total_count":15569},{"name":"奇幻","count":4,"total_count":467728},{"name":"中国动画","count":3,"total_count":2184},{"name":"短片","count":2,"total_count":102030},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35582},{"name":"游改","count":2,"total_count":2484},{"name":"2010s","count":1,"total_count":5588},{"name":"杉山紀彰","count":1,"total_count":144},{"name":"网野哲郎","count":1,"total_count":147},{"name":"日本","count":1,"total_count":293424},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1,"total_count":493969},{"name":"追番","count":1,"total_count":2629},{"name":"泡面番，201